{
  "_about": "Stations of the radio player in the Status app (Radio card and Radio panel). Fields: url = stream address (MP3/AAC/HLS); alt = backup addresses, tried in order when url does not play; uuid = Radio Browser entry (radio-browser.info): the app asks it for the current address as one more backup (servers de1, nl1, at1); upstream = real stream relayed by status-server.py at /radio-proxy/<id>, used when the WebView does not accept its format (audio/aacp) or the address needs the current time: {now} is replaced with the Unix time (Bauer/Rayo stations, parameter skey); rayo = station code in the Rayo API: the proxy refreshes the address from it once a day and keeps upstream as a backup; logo (optional) = path to a logo image in www/ (not included: station logos are trademarks); group tab = short tab name in the Radio panel. Checked every night by check-stations.py (result: radio-health.json).",
